 * Description: Continous output of the current time via .NET classes.
 * Shows:       - DateTime class: getting the current time.
 *              - Starting a CLRThread, which is a Thread and runs simultaneously to the main code
 *              - Reading input keys from console
 *               - Exiting an application manually with the "Environment" class
